# Bazel configuration for the XiOne cross-build. See XIONE-BUILD.md.
#
# Nothing here is required by the CMake build; a plain `cmake` invocation is
# unaffected by this file.

# The AAMP source tree is the workspace root, so //:all_srcs globs it. Keep the
# convenience symlinks out of the way of that glob (see also .bazelignore).
common --symlink_prefix=bazel-

# rules_foreign_cc shells out to CMake/Ninja and needs a real filesystem layout,
# and the AAMP build is one large action; the default sandbox is fine but the
# action is long, so don't let a slow link look like a hang.
build --verbose_failures

# The cross build only ever targets the XiOne. Spelling it here would break host
# builds of everything else, so it stays an explicit flag:
#   bazel build //:aamp --platforms=//bazel/platforms:xione
